{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## SoV covectors in the untwisting limit: which transfer matrices reach the singlet of $[2,1,0]^{\\otimes2}$?\n\nQuestion (Paul, 2026-09-23). The SoV basis is built from the $\\langle k_1^{u/h}Q_1\\rangle\\langle k_2^{u/h}Q_{12}\\rangle$ covectors $\\langle v_{\\rm tot}\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|$ (`L2-mathcalA.wb`) together with the fused transfer matrices $t_{\\{1,0\\}},t_{\\{1,1\\}},t_{\\{2,0\\}},t_{\\{2,1\\}}$. In the limit $z\\to1$, which of these reach the highest-weight states of $V\\otimes V$ that the base family misses, in particular the singlet $[2,2,2]$?\n\nMethod. We do not truncate at an order in $\\varepsilon$. Instead we take the genuine limit of the spanned subspace as $\\varepsilon\\to0$, so ratios such as $p_3=p_2(z_3-z_1)/(p_1(z_2-z_3))$ stay finite.\n- Twist $z_k=1+\\varphi_k\\varepsilon$ with fixed generic $\\varphi$. Everything else ($k_1,k_2,p_1,p_2$, spectral point $x$) is sampled at random rationals. So every covector is exact and rational in $\\varepsilon$ alone.\n- Limit of a span: $\\varepsilon$-adic reduction. Take the lowest-order coefficient vector of each basis row. While these are linearly dependent, replace the highest-order row in a dependency by the combination that cancels its leading term. The leading vectors that remain span the limiting subspace.\n- Reach: the rank of the limiting subspace paired with the hw vectors of each weight $\\nu$ of $V\\otimes V$. There is no need to undo $g_0\\otimes g_0$: $g_0\\in N_+$ fixes the hw vectors, and $g_0$ has a finite limit.\n- Chain conventions are those of `L2-localizing-transfer.wb`: $T=L_1L_2G$, $\\mathcal L_{ij}(x)=x\\delta_{ij}-hE_{ji}$, and $t_{\\{\\cdot\\}}$ is fused as there. $h=1$ and $\\theta=(1/3,-8/57)$ (point 1).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_] :=\n    ps[rep] =\n    Block[\n        {res = (Prepend[rep, #]& /@ (Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]))},\n        If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse @ Sort @ res, Reverse @ Sort @ Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]\n    ];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jp[k][pat] =\n    -Sum[\n        Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]\n        / Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJm[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jm[k][pat] =\n    Sum[\n        Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]\n        / Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] :=\n    JJ[k, l, rep] =\n    Which[\n        k == l,\n        DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n        l == k + 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l == k - 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l > k + 1,\n        JJ[k, k + 1, rep].JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n        l < k - 1,\n        JJ[k, k - 1, rep].JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k - 1, rep]\n    ];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. Chain, fused t's acting on row vectors, and the base covector <v_tot (x) vacL|. z_k = 1 + φ_k ε is the only symbolic input.\n   Rows are made polynomial in ε by clearing a common denominator (a scalar, so spans are unchanged). ---- *)\nClearAll[repS, dS, dcS, idS, ES, E1S, E2S, hS, thS, phiS, zS, TatS, qminS, actS, tfActS, lax1S, qmin1S, tHatS, expNS, rotS, polyRowS, baseS];\nrepS = {2, 1, 0}; dS = dim[repS]; dcS = dS^2; idS = IdentityMatrix[dS, SparseArray];\nES[i_, j_] := ES[i, j] = SparseArray[JJ[i, j, repS]];\nE1S[i_, j_] := E1S[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[ES[i, j], idS];\nE2S[i_, j_] := E2S[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[idS, ES[i, j]];\n{hS, thS} = {1, {1/3, -8/57}};\nphiS = {2/3, -1/5, 3/7};\nzS = 1 + phiS ε;\n\nTatS[i_, j_, x_] := Sum[((x - thS[[1]]) KroneckerDelta[i, k] IdentityMatrix[dcS, SparseArray] - hS E1S[k, i]) . ((x - thS[[2]]) KroneckerDelta[k, j] IdentityMatrix[dcS, SparseArray] - hS E2S[j, k]), {k, 3}];\nqminS[II_, x_] := qminS[II, x] = Sum[Signature[s] Dot @@ Table[TatS[II[[s[[k]]]], II[[k]], x - (k - 1) hS], {k, Length[II]}], {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\n(* v . t_a(x): G = diag(z) on the right, so each principal quantum minor carries z_I *)\nactS[v_, a_, x_] := Expand[Sum[(Times @@ zS[[II]]) Normal[v . qminS[II, x]], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}]];\ntfActS[v_, {1, 0}, x_] := actS[v, 1, x];\ntfActS[v_, {1, 1}, x_] := actS[v, 2, x];\ntfActS[v_, {2, 0}, x_] := Expand[actS[actS[v, 1, x], 1, x + hS] - actS[v, 2, x + hS]];\ntfActS[v_, {2, 1}, x_] := Expand[actS[actS[v, 2, x], 1, x + hS] - actS[v, 3, x + hS]];\n\n(* site-1 t-hat of L2-mathcalA / xxx-210-cg-test: t_2^(1)(θ1)/(ν1(θ1) ν1(θ1 - h)), ν1(x) = x - θ1 - h λ1 *)\nlax1S[i_, j_][x_] := (x - thS[[1]]) KroneckerDelta[i, j] IdentityMatrix[dS] - hS Normal[ES[j, i]];\nqmin1S[II_][x_] := Sum[Signature[s] Dot @@ Table[lax1S[II[[s[[k]]]], II[[k]]][x - (k - 1) hS], {k, Length[II]}], {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\ntHatS = Sum[(Times @@ zS[[II]]) qmin1S[II][thS[[1]]], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {2}]}] / ((-hS repS[[1]]) (-hS - hS repS[[1]]));\n\n(* nilpotent exponential; MatrixPower[M, 0] of a singular M must be avoided *)\nexpNS[M_] := IdentityMatrix[Length[M]] + Sum[MatrixPower[M, n] / n!, {n, 1, dS}];\nrotS[a_, b_, c_] := UnitVector[dS, 1] . expNS[a Normal[ES[1, 2]]] . expNS[b Normal[ES[1, 3]]] . expNS[c Normal[ES[2, 3]]];\npolyRowS[v_] := Module[{t = Together /@ v, den}, den = PolynomialLCM @@ (Denominator /@ t); Expand[Cancel[t den]]];\n\nbaseS[{k1_, k2_, p1_, p2_}] := Module[{p3, p1p, v1, vL, vtot},\n    p3 = p2 (zS[[3]] - zS[[1]]) / (p1 (zS[[2]] - zS[[3]]));\n    p1p = p1 (1 - k1 zS[[2]]) / (1 - k1 zS[[1]]);\n    v1 = (1 - k1 zS[[1]])^(repS[[1]] - repS[[2]]) rotS[p1p, p2, p3];\n    vL = rotS[p1, p2, p3];\n    vtot = v1 - k2 v1 . tHatS;\n    polyRowS[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[vtot, vL]]]\n];\n\n(* sanity: [t1, t2] = 0 at a numeric ε; base covector polynomial in ε *)\nGrid[{\n    {\"dim V (x) V\", dcS},\n    {\"[t1(2/5), t2(-3/7)] = 0 at ε = 2/7\", Module[{m1, m2},\n        m1 = Normal[Sum[(Times @@ (zS[[II]] /. ε -> 2/7)) qminS[II, 2/5], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {1}]}]];\n        m2 = Normal[Sum[(Times @@ (zS[[II]] /. ε -> 2/7)) qminS[II, -3/7], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {2}]}]];\n        m1 . m2 == m2 . m1]},\n    {\"base covector polynomial in ε\", Union[PolynomialQ[#, ε] & /@ baseS[{2/3, 5/7, 3/4, -4/9}]]}\n}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"282043\" data-output-id=\"8\" data-out-n=\"29\" data-sub-idx=\"27\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"2\" data-sub-start=\"40\" data-sub-end=\"47\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[29]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim V (x) V</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">[t1(2/5), t2(-3/7)] = 0 at </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord\"> = 2/7</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base covector polynomial in </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[29]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{dim V (x) V} & 64\\\\\\hline\\text{[t1(2/5), t2(-3/7)] = 0 at $\\varepsilon$ = 2/7} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{base covector polynomial in $\\varepsilon$} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
