  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 2. Highest-weight vectors of V (x) V, and the ε-adic limit of a span.\n   limitSpanS: rows polynomial in ε. Keep an independent set (rank at a random ε). Repeat: take each row's lowest-order coefficient\n   vector; if these are dependent, replace the row of highest order in the dependency by the combination that cancels its leading term.\n   The final leading vectors span lim_{ε->0} span(rows). ---- *)\nClearAll[Etot2S, wt2S, hwS, hwWtsS, ordS, leadS, limitSpanS, reachS];\nEtot2S[i_, j_] := E1S[i, j] + E2S[i, j];\nwt2S = Transpose[Table[Diagonal[Normal[Etot2S[i, i]]], {i, 3}]];\nhwS[nu_] := hwS[nu] = With[{idx = Flatten @ Position[wt2S, nu]},\n    With[{ns = NullSpace[Normal[Join[Etot2S[1, 2][[All, idx]], Etot2S[2, 3][[All, idx]]]]]}, Table[ReplacePart[ConstantArray[0, dcS], Thread[idx -> w]], {w, ns}]]];\nhwWtsS = Select[Union[wt2S], hwS[#] =!= {} &];\n\nordS[b_] := Min[Exponent[#, ε, Min] & /@ DeleteCases[b, 0]];\nleadS[b_, o_] := Coefficient[#, ε, o] & /@ b;\nlimitSpanS[rows_] := Module[{B, piv, os, L, ns, c, supp, j, it = 0},\n    B = Select[rows, Union[#] =!= {0} &];\n    If[B === {}, Return[{}]];\n    piv = Flatten[FirstPosition[#, 1] & /@ DeleteCases[RowReduce[Transpose[B /. ε -> 5/13]], {0 ..}]];\n    B = B[[piv]];\n    While[True,\n        it++;\n        os = ordS /@ B;\n        L = MapThread[leadS, {B, os}];\n        ns = NullSpace[Transpose[L]];\n        If[ns === {}, Break[]];\n        c = First[ns];\n        supp = Flatten @ Position[c, _?(# =!= 0 &), {1}, Heads -> False];\n        j = First @ MaximalBy[supp, os[[#]] &];\n        B[[j]] = Expand[Sum[c[[i]] ε^(os[[j]] - os[[i]]) B[[i]], {i, supp}]]\n    ];\n    L\n];\n(* rank of the limiting span paired with the hw vectors of each weight *)\nreachS[L_] := Table[If[L === {}, 0, MatrixRank[L . Transpose[hwS[nu]]]], {nu, hwWtsS}];\n\nGrid[{\n    {\"hw weights of V (x) V\", hwWtsS},\n    {\"# hw states per weight\", Length[hwS[#]] & /@ hwWtsS},\n    {\"<v_tot (x) vacL | singlet> at a sample point (should be 0 exactly)\", Expand[baseS[{2/3, 5/7, 3/4, -4/9}] . First[hwS[{2, 2, 2}]]]},\n    {\"limitSpanS test: rows (1, ε), (1, 2ε) -> limit spans\", limitSpanS[{{1, ε}, {1, 2 ε}}]}\n}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"282043\" data-output-id=\"9\" data-out-n=\"39\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"34\" data-sub-end=\"39\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[39]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:10.8401em;vertical-align:-5.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:10.8001em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hw weights of V (x) V</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># hw states per weight</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;v_tot (x) vacL | singlet&gt; at a sample point (should be 0 exactly)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">limitSpanS test: rows (1, </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord\">), (1, 2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord\">) -&gt; limit spans</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:10.8001em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:6.000em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"6.000em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 6000\"><path d=\"M863,9c0,-2,-2,-5,-6,-9c0,0,-17,0,-17,0c-12.7,0,-19.3,0.3,-20,1\nc-5.3,5.3,-10.3,11,-15,17c-242.7,294.7,-395.3,682,-458,1162c-21.3,163.3,-33.3,349,\n-36,557 l0,2484c0.2,6,0,26,0,60c2,159.3,10,310.7,24,454c53.3,528,210,\n949.7,470,1265c4.7,6,9.7,11.7,15,17c0.7,0.7,7,1,19,1c0,0,18,0,18,0c4,-4,6,-7,6,-9\nc0,-2.7,-3.3,-8.7,-10,-18c-135.3,-192.7,-235.5,-414.3,-300.5,-665c-65,-250.7,-102.5,\n-544.7,-112.5,-882c-2,-104,-3,-167,-3,-189\nl0,-2492c0,-162.7,5.7,-314,17,-454c20.7,-272,63.7,-513,129,-723c65.3,\n-210,155.3,-39