   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Result (cell 5, exact in $\\varepsilon$; 120 samples, sufficient in every family and sector)\n\nRank of $\\lim_{\\varepsilon\\to0}$(span of the family in the sector) paired with the hw vectors:\n\n| family | $[2,2,2]$ | $[3,2,1]$ (2) | $[3,3,0]$ | $[4,1,1]$ | $[4,2,0]$ | total |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| base | 0 | 1 | 1 | 1 | 1 | 4/6 |\n| base + $t_{\\{1,0\\}}$ | 0 | 1 | 1 | 1 | 1 | 4/6 |\n| base + $t_{\\{1,1\\}}$ | 0 | 2 | 1 | 1 | 1 | 5/6 |\n| base + $t_{\\{2,0\\}}$ | 1 | 2 | 1 | 1 | 1 | 6/6 |\n| base + $t_{\\{2,1\\}}$ | 1 | 2 | 1 | 1 | 1 | 6/6 |\n\n- The singlet is reached through $t_{\\{2,0\\}}$ and $t_{\\{2,1\\}}$ at a generic $x$. $t_{\\{1,1\\}}$ adds only the second $[3,2,1]$, and $t_{\\{1,0\\}}$ adds nothing. This is consistent with the channel count: $t_{\\{1,0\\}}$ has no $1\\to3$ channel.\n- **Caveat: the measure depends on the frame.** The base row gives 4/6 here and 5/6 in `xxx-210-cg-test.wb`. That notebook undid $g_0(p)$ covector by covector. The rotation depends on $p$, so it changes the span of the family, although it leaves every individual hw pairing unchanged. \"Limit of the span, then pair with the fixed untwisted hw vectors\" is therefore not intrinsic to the overlap data.\n- **The intrinsic quantity** is $\\lim\\langle c|\\Psi_A(\\varepsilon)\\rangle$ with the actual eigenvectors, normalized by $\\langle\\mathrm{vacL}\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|\\Psi_A\\rangle=1$. These limits are finite, since only ratios enter, and $\\langle c|t_\\lambda(x)|\\Psi_A\\rangle=\\tau_A(x)\\langle c|\\Psi_A\\rangle$ holds exactly. So transfer-matrix insertions only multiply these limits by eigenvalues. This has not been computed here.\n- Not done: a control run on a second untwisting curve (e.g. $z=1+\\varphi\\varepsilon+\\psi\\varepsilon^2$).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Which SoV covectors have a singlet component in the limit?\n\n$L=2$ SoV basis: the $L=1$ recipe of `old/XXX/Experiments/SU3_L1_Baxter_Twisted.wb` (cell 11) applied on each site, starting from $\\langle\\mathrm{vacL}\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|$:\n$$\\langle x_{g_1,g_2}|=\\langle\\mathrm{vacL}\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|\\,O_{g_1}(\\theta_1)\\,O_{g_2}(\\theta_2),$$\nwith $O_{\\{1\\},\\{0,0\\}}=1$, $O_{\\{1\\},\\{1,0\\}}=t_{\\{1,0\\}}$, $O_{\\{1\\},\\{1,1\\}}=t_{\\{1,1\\}}$, $O_{\\{2\\},\\{0,0\\}}=t_{\\{2,0\\}}t_{\\{1,0\\}}^{-1}$, $O_{\\{2\\},\\{1,0\\}}=t_{\\{2,0\\}}$, $O_{\\{2\\},\\{1,1\\}}=t_{\\{2,0\\}}t_{\\{1,0\\}}^{-1}t_{\\{1,1\\}}$, $O_{\\{2\\},\\{2,0\\}}=t_{\\{2,0\\}}t_{\\{1,0\\}}^{-1}t_{\\{2,0\\}}$ and $O_{\\{2\\},\\{2,1\\}}=t_{\\{2,0\\}}t_{\\{1,0\\}}^{-1}t_{\\{2,1\\}}$. All operators are evaluated at $u=\\theta_s$. Scalar ($\\nu$-ladder) rescalings are dropped, since only lines matter here. The transfer matrices commute with the total Cartan, so everything is built block by block in weight sectors.\n\nFor each covector, $n$ is the overall leading $\\varepsilon$-order (the minimum over components) and $m$ is the order of $\\langle x|\\mathrm{singlet}\\rangle$. The normalized limit $\\lim\\varepsilon^{-n}\\langle x|$ has a singlet component iff $m=n$. With $z=1+\\varphi\\varepsilon$, $p_3=p_2(\\varphi_3-\\varphi_1)/(p_1(\\varphi_2-\\varphi_3))$ is exactly $\\varepsilon$-independent.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. L = 2 SoV covectors <x_{g1,g2}| = <vacL (x) vacL| O_{g1}(θ1) O_{g2}(θ2), built per weight sector (definitions only;\n   the {n, m} singlet table is the next cell, ~3.5 min). ---- *)\nClearAll[secListS, qminNS, tBlkS, tfBlkS, invT10S, opBlkS, gtS, vacS, sovS, ordRS, sngS];\nsecListS = GatherBy[Range[dcS], wt2S[[#]] &];\nqminNS[II_, x_] := qminNS[II, x] = Normal[qminS[II, x]];\ntBlkS[a_, x_, idx_] := Sum[(Times @@ zS[[II]]) qminNS[II, x][[idx, idx]], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ntfBlkS[{1, 0}, x_, idx_] := tBlkS[1, x, idx];\ntfBlkS[{1, 1}, x_, idx_] := tBlkS[2, x, idx];\ntfBlkS[{2, 0}, x_, idx_] := Expand[tBlkS[1, x, idx] . tBlkS[1, x + hS, idx] - tBlkS[2, x + hS, idx]];\ntfBlkS[{2, 1}, x_, idx_] := Expand[tBlkS[2, x, idx] . tBlkS[1, x + hS, idx] - tBlkS[3, x + hS, idx]];\ninvT10S[x_, idx_] := invT10S[x, idx] = Together[Inverse[tfBlkS[{1, 0}, x, idx]]];\ngtS = {{{1}, {0, 0}}, {{1}, {1, 0}}, {{1}, {1, 1}}, {{2}, {0, 0}}, {{2}, {1, 0}}, {{2}, {1, 1}}, {{2}, {2, 0}}, {{2}, {2, 1}}};\nopBlkS[g_, x_, idx_] := opBlkS[g, x, idx] = Together @ Switch[g,\n    {{1}, {0, 0}}, IdentityMatrix[Length[idx]],\n    {{1}, {1, 0}}, tfBlkS[{1, 0}, x, idx],\n    {{1}, {1, 1}}, tfBlkS[{1, 1}, x, idx],\n    {{2}, {0, 0}}, tfBlkS[{2, 0}, x, idx] . invT10S[x, idx],\n    {{2}, {1, 0}}, tfBlkS[{2, 0}, x, idx],\n    {{2}, {1, 1}}, tfBlkS[{2, 0}, x, idx] . invT10S[x, idx] . tfBlkS[{1, 1}, x, idx],\n    {{2}, {2, 0}}, tfBlkS[{2, 0}, x, idx] . invT10S[x, idx] . tfBlkS[{2, 0}, x, idx],\n    {{2}, {2, 1}}, tfBlkS[{2, 0}, x, idx] . invT10S[x, idx] . tfBlkS[{2, 1}, x, idx]];\n(* vacL with p3 by the vacL relation (ε-independent on the linear curve) *)\nvacS[p1_, p2_] := With[{v = rotS[p1, p2, Together[p2 (zS[[3]] - zS[[1]]) / (p1 (zS[[2]] - zS[[3]]))]]}, Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v, v]]];\nsovS[vac_, g1_, g2_] := Module[{out = ConstantArray[0, dcS]},\n    Do[out[[idx]] = Together[vac[[idx]] . opBlkS[g1, thS[[1]], idx] . opBlkS[g2, thS[[2]], idx]], {idx, secListS}];\n    out];\nordRS[r_] := If[Together[r] === 0, Infinity, With[{t = Together[r]}, Exponent[Numerator[t], ε, Min] - Exponent[Denominator[t], ε, Min]]];\nsngS = First[hwS[{2, 2, 2}]];\nGrid[{{\"weight sectors of V (x) V\", Length[secListS]}, {\"SoV labels per site\", Length[gtS]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"282043\" data-output-id=\"10\" data-out-n=\"55\" data-sub-idx=\"17\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"28\" data-sub-end=\"28\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[55]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHt3ZWlnaHQgc2VjdG9ycyBvZiBWICh4KSBWfSAmIDE5XFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtTb1YgbGFiZWxzIHBlciBzaXRlfSAmIDhcXFxobGluZVxlbmR7YXJyYXl9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">weight sectors of V (x) V</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SoV labels per site</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">19</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[55]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{weight sectors of V (x) V} & 19\\\\\\hline\\text{SoV labels per site} & 8\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
