      {
       "data": "Out[70]= \\begin{matrix}\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{$\\varepsilon$=0 blocks of t\\_\\{1,0\\}($\\theta$\\_s) invertible (Neumann series valid)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{time (s)} & 4.457389\\\\\\hline\\text{u\\_x(0) all $\\propto$ e1 (x) e1} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{sector $\\nu$} & \\text{dim} & \\text{$\\mu$ = $\\nu$-(2,1,0)} & \\text{dim V\\_$\\mu$} & \\text{\\# $\\equiv$0} & \\text{\\# >K} & \\text{min order} & \\text{\\{order, \\#x\\}} & \\text{rank l (all)} & \\text{∩ V\\_$\\mu$$\\otimes$e1 (all)} & \\text{rank l (min order)} & \\text{∩ V\\_$\\mu$$\\otimes$e1 (min)}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & 1 & \\left\\{2,1,0\\right\\} & 1 & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 64\\end{pmatrix} & 1 & 1 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,1,1\\right\\} & 2 & \\left\\{2,0,1\\right\\} & 1 & 4 & 0 & 1 & \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 60\\end{pmatrix} & 2 & 1 & 2 & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,0,2\\right\\} & 1 & \\left\\{2,-1,2\\right\\} & 0 & 28 & 0 & 2 & \\begin{pmatrix}2 & 36\\end{pmatrix} & 1 & 0 & 1 & 0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} & 2 & \\left\\{1,2,0\\right\\} & 1 & 4 & 0 & 1 & \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 60\\end{pmatrix} & 2 & 1 & 2 & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} & 6 & \\left\\{1,1,1\\right\\} & 2 & 6 & 0 & 2 & \\begin{pmatrix}2 & 58\\end{pmat… [latex truncated: 3009 chars total]",
