  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 6. Graded limit: rescale sector ν by ε^-ht(ν), ht = (4,2,0) - ν in simple-root steps = the uniform leading order of cell 12.\n   Λ_x = ⊕_ν l_{x,ν}. Rank 64 means ONE ε-independent combination of the SoV covectors reproduces any graded target, e.g. (e1^T P) (x) e1^T\n   with P = exp(ε a E12 + ε^2 b E13 + ε c E23). ---- *)\nClearAll[htS, LamS];\nhtS[nu_] := ({4, 2, 0} - nu) . {2, 1, 0};\nLamS = Table[Table[Coefficient[uS[[x, n]], ε, htS[wt2S[[n]]]], {n, dcS}], {x, 64}];\nGrid[{\n    {\"leading order of every nonzero u_{x,ν} equals ht(ν)\", And @@ (#[[8]] === {{htS[#[[1]]], 64 - #[[5]]}} & /@ rowsS)},\n    {\"rank of the graded leading covectors Λ (of 64)\", MatrixRank[LamS]},\n    {\"graded limit at ε^0 of (e1 G^0) (x) e1 is in the span (trivially)\", MatrixRank[Append[LamS, Flatten[KroneckerProduct[UnitVector[dS, 1], UnitVector[dS, 1]]]]] == 64}\n}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
